     real gap, so tell me if you want a logout button in scope.
  2. [1mLogin failure.[0m The stub can't fail; a real call can. The submit handler currently has no error display, only
     [38;5;153mconsole.error[39m. Minimum is surfacing failure to the user somehow; anything beyond a text node is design work.
